{"id": "EUVD-2026-84102", "enisaUuid": "735b5eef-7fc8-3168-a365-779bd52f766c", "description": "Envoy is an open source edge and service proxy designed for cloud-native applications. Prior to 1.36.10, 1.37.6, 1.38.4, and 1.39.1, Envoy's HTTP external-authorization client can retain a stale request callback after a request is rejected. When RawHttpClientImpl::onSuccess later processes the authorization response, it can invoke callbacks_ after the callback owner has been destroyed, causing a use-after-free and process crash under production traffic. The relevant scope boundary is that the vulnerable path uses the HTTP ext_authz client; the advisory does not establish the same trigger for unrelated filters. This issue is fixed in versions 1.36.10, 1.37.6, 1.38.4, and 1.39.1.", "datePublished": "2026-09-21T19:32:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-22T13:30:59", "baseScore": 5.9, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/security/advisories/GHSA-q8wp-gf7q-m8cv", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/commit/8dacef38337aeffd62866b5c5910104b63b33db8", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/commit/a49085623654e27e9ad6298928557644b849d7ce", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/commit/c1b29534a294cb0999e99e1fe0de000310165f03", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/commit/c524571ffad517ba650d9563f85afa89194e2cfb", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/tag/v1.36.10", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/tag/v1.37.6", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/tag/v1.38.4", "https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/tag/v1.39.1"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-50572"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.68, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "53b83a78-adcf-3374-87f9-c1b9841aa847", "product": {"name": "envoy", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "1.39.0, < 1.39.1"}, {"id": "65cb24b3-fd2f-3e79-835a-e9698c2222c9", "product": {"name": "envoy", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "1.37.0, < 1.37.6"}, {"id": "6709f9da-8e55-31ee-bbec-787b05381c49", "product": {"name": "envoy", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "< 1.36.10"}, {"id": "9b27486b-b878-3b39-b669-9bf122e5a186", "product": {"name": "envoy", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "1.38.0, < 1.38.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "6e11f58b-9c83-365d-aa28-ffd6a3fafadf", "vendor": {"name": "envoyproxy"}}], "isExploited": false}